:PD.Basic.
:PT.:PK.*EXTENDED:EPK.
:PD.Extended detail.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKLNK/DSPOPT'.Display option (DSPOPT)
:P.The display option for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*PRV:EPK.
:PD.The previous release.
